    "title": "Lessons from the fire: How California is redesigning government services",
    "excerpt": "<p>Within 24 hours of the Altadena and Palisades fires breaking out in January 2025, teams across the state were already working together to help people who were affected. The Office of Data and Innovation (ODI) joined forces with the Governor&#8217;s Office, the California Department of Forestry and Fire Protection (CAL FIRE), California Governor’s Office of &#8230; <a title=\"Lessons from the fire: How California is redesigning government services\" class=\"read-more\" href=\"https://live-digital-ca-gov.pantheonsite.io/2026/09/16/lessons-from-the-fire-how-california-is-redesigning-government-services/\" aria-label=\"More on Lessons from the fire: How California is redesigning government services\">Read more</a></p>\n",
